{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Movie Theater is a building that allows players to watch movies, alone or with a guest, once every week. It is unlocked either by completing the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," or all ",["l","Joja社区发展申请书","community upgrades"]," offered by ",["l","莫里斯","Morris"],"."]],["p",["If players choose to restore the Community Center, the night before the first rainy or stormy day after restoring the Center, there is a cutscene of a lightning bolt striking the doors to the abandoned ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"],". Afterwards, the player may enter the abandoned JojaMart and find ",["l","收集包","the Missing Bundle"],". The night after completing the Missing Bundle, the ",["l","祝尼魔","Junimos"]," will build a Movie Theater."]],["p",["If players choose the Joja route, they can purchase the Movie Theater from Morris for 500,000g after completing all other ",["l","Joja社区发展申请书","community upgrades"],". The ",["l","Joja仓库","Joja Warehouse"]," will then become a Movie Theater."]],["p",["Players must purchase a ",["l","电影票","Movie Ticket"]," for 1,000g to enter the Movie Theater. A second Movie Ticket can also be purchased for 1,000g and given to a villager in the same way a gift is given. This will invite the villager to attend the movie with the player. To see the movie with the villager, enter the theater on the same day the ticket is gifted; otherwise, the ticket is forgotten."]],["p",["In a ",["l","合作","Multiplayer"]," game, it is possible to watch a movie with other players. To do this, all participating players must gather in the lobby before the movie starts. A message suggesting you will watch the movie by yourself still displays when entering the building, regardless of other players being present."]]]],["Movies",2,[["p",["There are 8 movies in total. Movies repeat on a 2-year cycle, based on the season in which the player unlocks the Movie Theater. All four \"year 1\" movies will cycle, followed by year 2 movies, then repeat. The year in the table below refers to the year in which the player first unlocks the Theater."]],["p",["Asking a guest to a loved movie earns 200 ",["l","友谊","Friendship"]," points with the guest, a liked movie earns 100 Friendship points, and a disliked movie neither earns nor costs friendship points with the guest."]],["p",["Note that ",["l","潘妮","Penny"]," will love any movie if ",["l","潘姆","Pam"]," is also present. However, this is only possible in multiplayer, as Pam will not attend the movie when inviting Penny."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Season / Year"]},{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]}],[["The Brave Little Sapling"],["An animated family comedy about a little sprout on a magical adventure to become a tree!"],[["l","春季","Spring"],", Y1"],[["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]],[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"]],[["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"]]],[["Journey Of The Prairie King: The Motion Picture"],["The beloved video game comes to the silver screen!"],[["l","夏季","Summer"],", Y1"],[["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]],[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","克林特","Cl