ame will be occupied prior to the movie. There is no limit to how many times the Crane Game can be played when it is available, but it must be played before watching the movie as it will always be occupied once the movie has finished."]],["p",["After paying to play, the player has 3 chances to grab a prize. There is a 15-second timer for each attempt, which begins when the player first moves the crane. Successfully grabbing a prize on chance 1 or 2 does not end the game, giving the player the opportunity to win 3 prizes. Each time the player pays for a new game, the prizes will be randomized."]],["p",["The crane is positioned using 2 movements. The first movement is horizontal, and places the crane (right-arrow on keyboard). The second movement is vertical, and drops the crane (down-arrow on keyboard). Once the down-arrow button is released, the crane will drop to the position of its shadow. When the crane reaches its shadow, it will stop and grab any prize at that location."]],["p",["The crane may drop the prize on its way to the collection chute on the left. The further away from the chute the item is, and the less firm the crane's grasp on the item is, the more likely it is to drop it. Centering the crane with the item will give it a firmer grasp and reduce the chance of the item being dropped before reaching the collection chute."]],["p",["Prizes include items on the conveyor belts as well as some of the stationary items shown. Some of the more rare prizes (like the ",["l","恐龙蛋","Dinosaur Egg"]," or ",["l","电影票","Movie Ticket"],") can be hidden behind foliage in the Crane Game and may become dislodged when the crane drops another prize."]]]],["Prizes",3,[["l",0,[[1,["Anytime: ",["l","福坦熊","Futan Bear"],", ",["l","福坦兔","Futan Rabbit"],", ",["l","小祝尼魔毛绒玩具","Small Junimo Plush"]," (any color), ",["l","大福坦熊","Lg. Futan Bear"],", ",["l","恐龙蛋","Dinosaur Egg"],", ",["l","万象晶球","Omni Geode"],", ",["l","传送图腾：农场","Warp Totem: Farm"],", ",["l","超级炸弹","Mega Bomb"],", ",["l","电影票","Movie Ticket"],", ",["l","异国情调的树","Exotic Tree"],", ",["l","豪华树","Deluxe Tree"],", ",["l","家居植物","House Plant 13"],", ",["l","精致盆栽","Fancy House Plants 4 & 5"],", Poster from current movie"]],[1,["Spring: ",["l","室内吊篮","Indoor Hanging Basket"],", ",["l","绒毛兔子","Plush Bunny"],", ",["l","草坪火烈鸟","Lawn Flamingo"],", ",["l","季节性装饰","Seasonal Decor"],", ",["l","季节性植物","Seasonal Plant"],"s #1, 2, 3, or 6"]],[1,["Summer: ",["l","室内椰子树","Indoor Palm"],", (if Wumbus is playing: ",["l","温布斯雕像","Wumbus Statue"],", ",["l","波波雕像","Bobo Statue"],"), (if Journey of the Prairie King is playing: ",["l","长棕榈","Long Palm"],", ",["l","长仙人掌","Long Cactus"],")"]],[1,["Fall: ",["l","小壁挂南瓜","Small Wall Pumpkin"],", ",["l","壁挂南瓜","Wall Pumpkin"],", ",["l","风干太阳花","Dried Sunflowers"],", ",["l","墓石","Grave Stone"],", ",["l","绿蛇雕像","Green Serpent Statue"],", ",["l","紫蛇雕像","Purple Serpent Statue"]]],[1,["Winter: ",["l","冬季树贴纸","Winter Tree Decal"],", ",["l","大红杖","Big Red Cane"],", ",["l","大绿杖","Big Green Cane"],", ",["l","绿杖","Green Canes"],", ",["l","红杖","Red Canes"],", ",["l","混色杖","Mixed Cane"],", ",["l","冬日星树","Tree of the Winter Star"]]]]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]," will not attend movies on ",["l","周循环","Fridays"],"."]],[1,["The cooldown to watch a movie resets on Mondays. The cooldown does not apply if the player enters the theater and leaves without watching the movie."]],[1,["Even though Shane and Pam hate ",["l","Joja可乐","Joja Cola"]," as a gift, Pam likes and Shane loves the Joja Cola concession snack."]],[1,["Despite being clear analogs for one another, the Personal Pizza and the ",["l","披萨","Pizza"]," have notably different tastes among the NPCs; many NPCs who like Pizza dislike the Personal Pizza."]],[1,["NPCs that can appear in the lobby include ",["l","冈瑟","Gunther"],", the ",["l","州长","Governor"],", ",["l","夜市","Famous Painter Lupini"],", ",["l","电视","Welwick"]," the Fortune Teller, and Marcello, the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"],", who also appears in ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],"'s 10-heart event."]],[1,[["l","电影票","Movie tickets"]," can be purchased on ",["l","节日","festival days"],", but entry to the theater is not permitted. Attempting to give a ticket to a ",["l","居民","villager"]," on a festival day will result in a popup box saying: \"The movie theater isn't open on festival days!\"."]],[1,["The Movie Theater cannot be entered when it's closed by using the ",["l","小镇钥匙","Key To The Town"],"."]],[1,[["l","雷欧","Leo"]," cannot be invited to the Movie Theater before the player reaches 6 hearts with him."]]]]]],["Trivia",2,[["l",0,[[1,["In 2011, ",["l","ConcernedApe","ConcernedApe"]," created a series of comics called Wumbus World."]],[1,["Even though ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"]," is a video gamer, she only likes, not loves, \"Journey of the Prarie King: The Motion Picture\""]]]]]],["Bugs",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","潘姆","Pam"]," will never randomly attend a movie if the player invites ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],". It is possible, however, in ",["l","合作","Multiplayer"]," for two players to invite them and attend a movie together."]]]]]]]}